        "Obtaining Comment URNs",
        "Method 1: Using the commentsOnEntity Finder"
      ],
      "Text": "Step 2: Use the returned comment URNs with the DMA Comments BATCH_GET API below.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
