        "Method 1: Using the commentsOnEntity Finder"
      ],
      "Text": "The entity parameter supports: urn:li:share, urn:li:ugcPost, urn:li:groupPost, urn:li:activity, and urn:li:comment.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI",
      "Anchor": "method-2-copy-comment-link-from-linkedin-ui",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Example \u2014 Nested Comment",
        "Obtaining Comment URNs",
        "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI"
      ],
      "Text": "To obtain the Comment URN from LinkedIn:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI",
      "Anchor": "method-2-copy-comment-link-from-linkedin-ui",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Example \u2014 Nested Comment",
        "Obtaining Comment URNs",
        "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI"
      ],
      "Text": "Navigate to the comment on LinkedIn (either a top-level comment on a post or a nested comment/reply)\nClick the three dots (\u2022\u2022\u2022) menu icon on the comment\nSelect Copy link to comment from the menu options\nThe copied URL will follow this pattern:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI",
      "Anchor": "method-2-copy-comment-link-from-linkedin-ui",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Example \u2014 Nested Comment",
        "Obtaining Comment URNs",
        "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI"
      ],
      "Text": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:{ACTIVITY_ID}/?commentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28activity%3A{ACTIVITY_ID}%2C{COMMENT_ID}%29",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI",
      "Anchor": "method-2-copy-comment-link-from-linkedin-ui",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Example \u2014 Nested Comment",
        "Obtaining Comment URNs",
        "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI"
      ],
      "Text": "Extract and URL-decode the commentUrn query parameter value to get the usable Comment URN:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI",
      "Anchor": "method-2-copy-comment-link-from-linkedin-ui",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Example \u2014 Nested Comment",
        "Obtaining Comment URNs",
        "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI"
      ],
      "Text": "urn:li:comment:(urn:li:activity:{ACTIVITY_ID},{COMMENT_ID})",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI",
      "Anchor": "method-2-copy-comment-link-from-linkedin-ui",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Example \u2014 Nested Comment",
        "Obtaining Comment URNs",
        "Method 2: Copy Comment Link from LinkedIn UI"
      ],
      "Text": "This CommentUrn may then be passed to the DMA Comments API via the ids parameter. This method applies to both top-level comments and nested comments.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get a Collection of Comments",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get a Collection of Comments",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/rest/dmaComments?ids=List(urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28urn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A{ACTIVITY_ID}%2C{COMMENT_ID}%29)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get a Collection of Comments",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X GET \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/dmaComments?ids=List(urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28urn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A{ACTIVITY_ID}%2C{COMMENT_ID}%29)\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Linkedin-Version: {version number in the format YYYYMM}\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get a Collection of Comments",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n  \u0022results\u0022: {\n    \u0022urn:li:comment:(urn:li:activity:{ACTIVITY_ID},{COMMENT_ID})\u0022: {\n      \u0022id\u0022: {COMMENT_ID},\n      \u0022lastModified\u0022: {\n        \u0022actor\u0022: \u0022urn:li:organization:109761421\u0022,\n        \u0022time\u0022: 1763375562669\n      },\n      \u0022created\u0022: {\n        \u0022actor\u0022: \u0022urn:li:organization:109761421\u0022,\n        \u0022time\u0022: 1763375562669\n      },\n      \u0022commentary\u0022: {\n        \u0022attributes\u0022: [],\n        \u0022text\u0022: \u0022Test\u0022\n      },\n      \u0022object\u0022: \u0022urn:li:activity:{ACTIVITY_ID}\u0022\n    }\n  },\n  \u0022statuses\u0022: {\n    \u0022urn:li:comment:(urn:li:activity:{ACTIVITY_ID},{COMMENT_ID})\u0022: 200\n  },\n  \u0022errors\u0022: {}\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieving Multiple Comments",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-multiple-comments",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get a Collection of Comments",
        "Retrieving Multiple Comments"
      ],
      "Text": "To retrieve multiple comments in a single request, separate comment URNs with commas inside the List() parameter:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieving Multiple Comments",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-multiple-comments",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get a Collection of Comments",
        "Retrieving Multiple Comments"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Retrieving Multiple Comments",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-multiple-comments",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Batch Get a Collection of Comments",
        "Retrieving Multiple Comments"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/rest/dmaComments?ids=List(urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28urn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A{ACTIVITY_ID}%2C{COMMENT_ID_1}%29,urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28urn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A{ACTIVITY_ID}%2C{COMMENT_ID_2}%29,urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28urn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A{ACTIVITY_ID}%2C{COMMENT_ID_3}%29)",
      "Headers": [],
